: inherit; font-weight: inherit; text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--theme-text-color); letter-spacing: var(--theme-letter-spacing); text-transform: var(--theme-text-transform);\">Kegiatan ini diharapkan dapat memperkuat hubungan kerjasama antara institusi pendidikan dan industri.<\/span><\/p><p>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u00a0<br \/>Join us \ud83d\udcf2\u00a0<br \/>Website : www.stmi.ac.id<br \/>IG: @stmijakarta<br \/>Twitter: @stmijakarta<br \/>Facebook: Politeknik STMI Jakarta<br \/>WA : 085155244455<\/p><p>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br \/>Kementerian Perindustrian RI<br \/>#politeknikstmijakarta\u00a0<br \/>#Politeknik<br \/>#STMIJakarta<br \/>#STMIWBK<br \/>#STMIMenujuWBBM<br \/>#Kampus<br \/>#VokasiKompeten<br \/>#SobatIndustri<br \/>#JoinSTMI<br \/>#kementerianperindustrian<br \/>#kegiatankampus<\/p><div>\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&nbsp; Jakarta, 5 Juni 2024 telah dilaksanakan kegiatan Perpanjangan Perjanjian Kerja Sama Pelaksanaan Pelatihan Setara Diploma 1 antara Politeknik STMI Jakarta dengan PT Komatsu Indonesia. Turut hadir juga Kepala BPSDMI Drs. Masrokhan, MAP, CGCAE untuk menyaksikan Perpanjangan Perjanjian Kerja Sama Pelaksanaan Pelatihan Setara Diploma 1 antara Politeknik STMI Jakarta dengan PT Komatsu Indonesia Kegiatan ini [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2224,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[22],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2223","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-berita-kampus"],"blocksy_meta":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2223","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-json\/